      "content": "wait really?? he seems okay otherwise though. he's playing with his toys and isn't acting super sick or anything, just has a little fever. i feel like if it was actually that bad he would be way more lethargic or something. are you sure i need to go to the er right now? it's almost midnight and the wait would be huge",
